WEBVTT

00:06:30.803 --> 00:06:34.056
They are now found
in our bloodstream and our lungs.

00:06:34.557 --> 00:06:37.059
And personally, the most terrifying,

00:06:37.101 --> 00:06:40.062
in the placenta of our unborn children.

00:06:42.356 --> 00:06:45.317
Now, of course, plastic
is a great material,

00:06:45.317 --> 00:06:47.862
it's versatile and durable,

00:06:47.903 --> 00:06:51.657
and in many ways it has allowed
modern civilization

00:06:51.699 --> 00:06:53.617
to develop in the way it has.

00:06:54.326 --> 00:06:58.122
But it also comes with a lot of problems

00:06:58.164 --> 00:07:00.749
and the outlook is worrying.